# Deploy means everything changed

When the user says deploy, ship every local change, update, and new file in the web app and the API.

- Include uncommitted work. Do not leave related edits out of the commit.
- STLWeb goes to production by committing and pushing `main`, which Vercel builds.
- STLAPI goes live by committing and pushing to Heroku `master` on `stl-api-testing`.
- Skip only secrets (`.env`, credentials). Say so if a file was left out for that reason.
